==Battleground==
*8 [[Lione Hippoe]]s (100%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] (400%) spawns as the boss.
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~4 seconds<sup>2f~120f</sup>.
**1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns.
**2 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] (400%) spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] (400%) spawns.
*When the base reaches 40% HP:
**16 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07~0.67 seconds<sup>2f~20f</sup>.
**1 [[Lione Hippoe]] (400%) spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage can be difficult for new players due to the high amount of Gory Darks. Although, they can be easily countered by bringing multiple meatshields such as [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Samba Cat]]. Using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can help deal with the high-health Lione Hippoes and Gory Darks.

